 stone farmhouses are some of the most durable and beautiful homes in Pennsylvania. They can be made comfortable without compromising their character. We specialize in HVAC retrofits that respect the thermal behavior of the building and work with it, not against it.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Schedule the Visit<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--3\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"tel:+1\">Call Now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"s-credits has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Photos: AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image) \u00b7 &quot;Starting up again (1 of 4)&quot; by Unhindered by Talent, BY-SA, via Openverse \u00b7 &quot;Ductless Mini Split Heat Pump Installation&quot; by Vernon Air Con, BY-SA, via Openverse<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>HVAC for Doylestown stone farmhouses: radiant heat, thermal mass, insulation, and zoning strategies for high-mass construction.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":0,"featured_media":1791,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"location","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_angie_page":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-122","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.0 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Your Doylestown Stone Farmhouse Stores Heat \u2014 Your Furnace Ignores It - Keystone Comfort Co.<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"HVAC for Doylestown stone farmhouses: radiant heat, thermal mass, insulation, and zoning strategies for high-mass construction.\" \/>\n<met